an** per-well gain. So `False` is the arm\nreports/q53_simulator_retrieval_penalty_correction_2026-07-30.md-37-  our own held-out evidence supports.\n--\nreports/q56_pf_backward_smoothing_2026-07-30.md-33-```\nreports/q56_pf_backward_smoothing_2026-07-30.md-34-pos  += rate*dm + 0.005*eps        (PN = 0.005)\nreports/q56_pf_backward_smoothing_2026-07-30.md-35-rate  = 0.998*rate + 0.002*eps     (MOM = 0.998, VN = 0.002)\nreports/q56_pf_backward_smoothing_2026-07-30.md-36-```\nreports/q56_pf_backward_smoothing_2026-07-30.md-37-\nreports/q56_pf_backward_smoothing_2026-07-30.md:38:so that backward kernel is numerically degenerate — `p(x_{i+1}^j | x_i^k)` is ~0 for every *k* except *j*'s\nreports/q56_pf_backward_smoothing_2026-07-30.md-39-own lineage. **In that limit FFBSi collapses onto the ancestral-path smoother**, so that is what was\nreports/q56_pf_backward_smoothing_2026-07-30.md-40-implemented (Kitagawa's filter-smoother) rather than a numerically doomed transcription of the general form:\nreports/q56_pf_backward_smoothing_2026-07-30.md-41-\nreports/q56_pf_backward_smoothing_2026-07-30.md-42-```\nreports/q56_pf_backward_smoothing_2026-07-30.md-43-sm[i] = Σ_j w_end[j] · pos_i^{ancestor_i(j)} − z_i\n--\nreports/q56_pf_backward_smoothing_2026-07-30.md-70-```\nreports/q56_pf_backward_smoothing_2026-07-30.md-71-\nreports/q56_pf_backward_smoothing_2026-07-30.md-72-The last line is a second, independent check: at the final row there is no lookahead, so the smoother must\nreports/q56_pf_backward_smoothing_2026-07-30.md-73-reproduce the filter there — and it does, to 1e-6 (float32 trellis storage).\nreports/q56_pf_backward_smoothing_2026-07-30.md-74-\nreports/q56_pf_backward_smoothing_2026-07-30.md:75:**(b) Path degeneracy measured BEFORE any arm was scored** — Q54 and Q55 both required the failure-mode\nreports/q56_pf_backward_smoothing_2026-07-30.md-76-diagnostic first, and ancestral smoothers have a well-known one: after enough resampling every lineage shares\nreports/q56_pf_backward_smoothing_2026-07-30.md-77-one ancestor, so far from the end the \"smoothed\" value is a single particle's path, i.e. *less* averaging\nreports/q56_pf_backward_smoothing_2026-07-30.md-78-than the filter. Measured (seed 0, well `000d7d20`, T=600 toe rows):\nreports/q56_pf_backward_smoothing_2026-07-30.md-79-\nreports/q56_pf_backward_smoothing_2026-07-30.md-80-```\n--\nreports/q56_pf_backward_smoothing_2026-07-30.md-125-```\nreports/q56_pf_backward_smoothing_2026-07-30.md-126-\nreports/q56_pf_backward_smoothing_2026-07-30.md-127-What the smoke establishes (it is **not** the measurement):\nreports/q56_pf_backward_smoothing_2026-07-30.md-128-\nreports/q56_pf_backward_smoothing_2026-07-30.md-129-- **the flag activates and the reporting path reaches the gate** — Directive 4's requirement;\nreports/q56_pf_backward_smoothing_2026-07-30.md:130:- **alignment holds** — 12/12 wells passed both the `ridx` and truth-equality assertions, 0 rejected;\nreports/q56_pf_backward_smoothing_2026-07-30.md-131-- **two monotonicities**, which is what distinguishes a mechanism from a fitted artifact:\nreports/q56_pf_backward_smoothing_2026-07-30.md-132-  - monotone in **alpha** (0.25 → 0.5 → 1.0 all improve, for every mode);\nreports/q56_pf_backward_smoothing_2026-07-30.md-133-  - monotone in **lookahead dose** (block25 → block100 → block400 → full: +0.028 → +0.109 → +0.283 →\nreports/q56_pf_backward_smoothing_2026-07-30.md-134-    +0.513). More lookahead, more gain, in order.\nreports/q56_pf_backward_smoothing_2026-07-30.md-135-\n--\nreports/q56_pf_backward_smoothing_2026-07-30.md-192-- **The result is not in yet.** §5 is a smoke on 12 wells at NS=8, and those wells are easier than average\nreports/q56_pf_backward_smoothing_2026-07-30.md-193-  (7.88 vs the deployed 9.2987), so the effect size there is not the effect size.\nreports/q56_pf_backward_smoothing_2026-07-30.md-194-- NS=32 vs the deployed NS=64 (§7).\nreports/q56_pf_backward_smoothing_2026-07-30.md-195-- The trellis is stored as **float32** to bound memory (T×N per seed); the final-row check quantifies the\nreports/q56_pf_backward_smoothing_2026-07-30.md-196-  resulting error at 1e-6 ft, which is 7 orders below the RMSE scale.\nreports/q56_pf_backward_smoothing_2026-07-30.md:197:- The path-degeneracy diagnostic is **one well, one seed**. A well with much more frequent resampling could\nreports/q56_pf_backward_smoothing_2026-07-30.md-198-  collapse where this one did not — the block arms exist to bound exactly that, and their ordering in §5\nreports/q56_pf_backward_smoothing_2026-07-30.md-199-  suggests it is not happening broadly, but it is not measured per well.\nreports/q56_pf_backward_smoothing_2026-07-30.md-200-- The smoother is applied per seed **before** the likelihood-weighted ensembling, which is the deployed\nreports/q56_pf_backward_smoothing_2026-07-30.md-201-  order. Smoothing after ensembling was not tested.\nreports/q56_pf_backward_smoothing_2026-07-30.md-202-- alpha is capped at 1.0; the monotone alpha trend means an extrapolating alpha > 1 was not explored, and\nreports/q56_pf_backward_smoothing_2026-07-30.md:203:  extrapolation is not the shrinkage class Rule #1 records as transferring.\nreports/q56_pf_backward_smoothing_2026-07-30.md-204-\nreports/q56_pf_backward_smoothing_2026-07-30.md-205-## 10. Next\nreports/q56_pf_backward_smoothing_2026-07-30.md-206-\nreports/q56_pf_backward_smoothing_2026-07-30.md-207-Collect `reports/logs/q56_smoothing_2026-07-30.log`, apply the §8 gate, and either queue the honest-kernel\nreports/q56_pf_backward_smoothing_2026-07-30.md-208-reproduction or close the line. `q57_dip_state_augmented_dp` is next by priority.\n--\nreports/q56_pf_backward_smoothing_2026-07-30.md-210-costs no quota.\nreports/q56_pf_backward_smoothing_2026-07-30.md-211-\nreports/q56_pf_backward_smoothing_2026-07-30.md-212-## RESULT — collected 2026-07-29 23:20 UTC. 760/760 wells, 108.6 min. **GATE FAILS on the 3-well condition; the other two pass.**\nreports/q56_