MOKE CREDIBLE SURVIVED AT FULL SCALE: lookahead dose-response still monotone on 760 wells (block25 +0.0205, block100 +0.0768, block400 +0.1898, full +0.3686), monotone in alpha for every mode, and the Savitzky-Golay denoising control buys only +0.0383 against the smoother's +0.3686, so ~90% of the gain is lookahead information a symmetric filter cannot supply (the smoke put it at 92%). NOT TAIL-DRIVEN: 68.9% helped with a POSITIVE median, the exact opposite of the GR-sigma multiplier's signature (Q19/Q36: 41.7%/42.1% helped, NEGATIVE median) which the ledger records before the 54878409 public regression. ON THE FAILING CONDITION: P(gain>0) is 0.7919, Q41 showed the 3-well 5th is maximised by changing nothing, and Q44 measured the 3-well draw's difference-sd at 2.40 ft, ~9x this effect -- so that condition mostly constrains what a PUBLIC score can resolve, not novel-well quality. This does NOT convert the FAIL into a PASS and is not used to. FOR SCALE: the deployed structural-field stage is worth +0.436 (9.2987 -> 8.8626) and this smoother is worth +0.2625 against the same starting point -- about 60% of that whole stage, from a change that adds no new inputs. DISPOSITION: not promoted on this evidence; queued q58_honest_kernel_backward_smoothing to reproduce the smoother inside the honest kernel and RE-FIT the structural-field stage against the smoothed PF (it was fitted against the FORWARD PF, so its +0.436 is not transferable as-is), then apply the submit gate. The blend-level number is not the deployed line's number.\", \"finished_at\": \"2026-07-29T23:20:00Z\"}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
